      en: ["Site of the largest coal mining operation in Zambia", "Home to a major thermal power station supplying the grid", "Located in the Gwembe Valley within Sinazongwe District", "Elevation is approximately 600 meters above sea level", "Commercial coal production began in the late 1960s", "Vital energy supplier for the country's Copperbelt region"],
